  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 4 ('Bixie Hive (the live dungeon: Drone Fauzz's bixie soldiers and battlemages throu'): scene sg_bixie_hive, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Drone Fauzz last; every spot is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Card: Global.Text 5702, 15336, icon 662 (the field_battles.json row 12370 this entrance ran before); rewards: its 68 coins and prize rows."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene sg_bixie_hive needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 13003*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Bixie Queen: Global.Text 16234; body Resources/Models.txt 217 bixie_f_queen.adr is described as 'Bixie Queen'"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Bixie Queen stands at the middle of the fork's last group (where its boss waits) and speaks the notes page's lines in order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Frightened Bixie Worker: Global.Text 130479; body (R) the client model table's 'Bixie Male Gatherer' (bixie_m_gatherer.adr), the hive's worker bixie; no client or reference row names the worker's body"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Bonus: 4 Frightened Bixie Workers, each mirrored inside one of the fork's guard groups along the way; a talk frees one, it says its line and runs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Finale: 3 waves of bixie_soldier, bixie_battlemage, bixie_soldier at the fork's last group, the first when a player comes within 12 m of Bixie Queen, each next one when the one before is down or 30 s after it; one wave per line of hers that calls more in."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done when the boss falls; the boss waits, dormant, for the waves. The results follow the exit door, which opens with the main goal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Built by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/bixie_hive.json, its notes page and the fork battle; the entrance counts as battle 12370 for quests."
    }
  ]
